<h1>Hello <%= @display_name %>,</h1>

<p>We received a request to reset your Facet password. You can choose a new password using the link below:</p>

<p><a href="<%= @reset_link %>"><%= @reset_link %></a></p>

<p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px;">This link expires in <%= @validity %>. If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email — your password will not be changed.</p>

<p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px;">— Facet</p>
